              <Node Name="UtcNow" Bounds="620,2700,80,80" Id="TFXFTl2j4KZNmsJlAo6Pb6" Summary="Checks the computers main-board clock when it's called and returns the UTC time." Remarks="Can return different values when used multiple times in the same frame. Low resolution (several milliseconds) and not sync-locked with the CPU. Use it for tasks like displaying time of day, generating file names etc. For high-resolution time measurement use the CurrentTime node." Tags="current,time">
